# ArcKit code ownership
# https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositories-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners
#
# Domain maintainers are auto-requested for review when files in their
# scope change. They are not required reviewers — the repository owner
# remains the final approver.

# Default — repo maintainer reviews everything not otherwise scoped.
*                                              @tractorjuice

# NOTE: overlay plugin sources live under plugins/arckit-<x>/ (canonical) and are
# mirrored into plugins/arckit-claude/plugins/<x>/ by scripts/sync-claude-plugin-layout.py.
# Patterns must point at those real paths — the former arckit-claude/... paths matched
# no files, so maintainers were never auto-requested.

# EU regulatory overlay — community-maintained by @thomas-jardinet
plugins/arckit-eu/commands/eu-*.md                        @thomas-jardinet @tractorjuice
plugins/arckit-eu/templates/eu-*-template.md              @thomas-jardinet @tractorjuice
plugins/arckit-claude/plugins/eu/**                       @thomas-jardinet @tractorjuice
.arckit/templates/eu-*-template.md                        @thomas-jardinet @tractorjuice
docs/guides/eu-*.md                                       @thomas-jardinet @tractorjuice
plugins/arckit-claude/docs/guides/eu-*.md                 @thomas-jardinet @tractorjuice

